      "en": "but in his own time revealed his word in the message with which I was entrusted according to the commandment of God our Savior,",
      "ko": "자기 때에 자기의 말씀을 전도로 나타내셨으니 이 전도는 우리 구주 하나님의 명대로 내게 맡기신 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "dd9a419b848ddfc596217e37082096c28630f98c0dab57e6eb1831fb4daafba4",
      "translation_text_hash": "4efc076c00d1cb28eb916f0452de874a1cc28ca5f5758de8d3edeb20e07a3f40",
