      "en": "I left you in Crete for this reason, that you would set in order the things that were lacking and appoint elders in every city, as I directed you—",
      "ko": "내가 너를 그레데에 떨어뜨려 둔 이유는 부족한 일을 바로잡고 나의 명한대로 각 성에 장로들을 세우게 하려 함이니",
      "source_text_hash": "6eba14436de2ae15b7bd15b31147d003cebf240bd7e2c69c98a580b57d7b641e",
      "translation_text_hash": "6bf1272685cd0d586f48b857d26fb878b6e5920b74f1f452180eb440932b49e4",
